the fcitx bindings here are fcitx4 only (fcitx-gclient and the Fcitx-1.0 gir), and
fcitx4 is gone, so the input method side of it can't build. the fcitx source type
still parses out of gsettings and still shows its raw name, it just has no proxy to
ask for a pretty name or a current engine, which is what an inactive fcitx looks
like anyway.

